<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Robert Cornell upgraded Foster Wheeler Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited in summary report company's above-consensus second quarter earnings per share.</p>
<p>-- said bookings were up 17 percent year-over-year, pushing backlog to record level.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;Foster Wheeler now positioned for sustained growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock rose 1-3/16 to 45.</p>
</text>
